        ],
        "note": "1 row. The three coefficients of S15(d)'s A/C activity quadratic. At 66.9 degF they give -0.0189 and the clamp makes the A/C factor exactly 0; 0.3 degF warmer and a 14.6% addition to the MY1980 gasoline rate switches on.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
